@Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7214

### Upload a recording chunk (sample video lives in ./samples)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/recordings/3f2b8c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/chunks
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunkIndex"

0
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="19600-303877318_medium.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./samples/19600-303877318_medium.mp4
--boundary--

###

### Upload a screenshot chunk (sample video lives in ./samples)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/screenshots/3f2b8c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/chunks
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunkIndex"

1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Screenshot 2026-10-30 125725.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/Screenshot 2026-10-30 125725.png
--boundary--

###
